@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam MaxMessageSize 150

actor "Engenheiro de QA" as QA
participant "Interface React\n(App)" as Web
participant "authServer\n(Core API, Go)" as Core
participant "control.json" as Ctrl
participant "run-audit.mjs\n(pool de VUs)" as Runner

QA -> Web: Ajustar concorrência/chaos\nou Pausar/Retomar/Finalizar
activate Web
Web -> Core: POST /test/control | /test/pause | /test/resume | /test/stop
activate Core
Core -> Ctrl: mergeWriteAuditControl(targetVirtualUsers, chaos, paused)
Core --> Web: 200 OK
deactivate Core

loop A cada ~1s, enquanto o teste roda
    Runner -> Ctrl: readControlSync()
    activate Runner
    Runner -> Runner: ajusta o pool (spawn/stop VUs),\naplica chaos via CDP e pausa o dwell
    deactivate Runner
end

opt Finalizar teste (/test/stop)
    Core -> Runner: cancela o processo (context)
    Core -> Web: broadcast 'test_stopped' (WebSocket)
end
deactivate Web
@enduml
